.squad-workstream


# CLI runtime output
summary.md
# Digest writer output — *.md are now durable artifacts (constitution v2.0.0,
# Phase 0 PR merged 2026-05-31). Only .gitkeep is still auto-ignored here
# so an empty dir can be committed; individual *.md files are committed by
# discord-monitor.yml after each run.
# Squad: ignore runtime state (logs, inbox, sessions)
.squad/.cache/
# Squad: state owned by squad-state branch (two-layer/orphan backend)
.squad/decisions.md
# Squad: local-only mutable decisions ledger; the archive remains tracked
.squad/decisions/decisions.md
# Squad: memory directory is backend-owned runtime state, except the static
# policy file config.json (constitution-tracked, safe to version — PR #314)
.squad/memory/*
!.squad/memory/config.json
.squad/agents/*/history.md
.squad/fact-checker/audit-trail.md
# Squad: backend-owned mutable state migrated out of the index (PR #314);
# physical copies are preserved on disk but no longer tracked
.squad/identity/
.squad/casting/history.json
.squad/rai/audit-trail.md
# Squad: bare and timestamped archive variants (e.g.
# history-archive-2026-06-02.md, history-archive-20260602T044144Z.md)
.squad/agents/*/history-archive*
# /Squad: state owned by squad-state branch
